Template: tt-bio-demo-runtime/install-deps
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Run "tt-bio install-deps" now?
 tt-bio needs Tenstorrent system packages and kernel modules that are not
 installable from this package's dependencies. Its own installer,
 "tt-bio install-deps", fetches and installs them.
 .
 This touches the host well beyond this package -- it installs kernel
 modules -- so it is never run without being asked for. Declining is the
 default and is safe: the exact command to run later is printed at the end
 of this installation, and nothing else about the booth depends on
 answering yes here.
